=2 Walkthrough
Talk to {n:Totoroon} and he'll ask for "Sweets, with shooogary taste, yooo know?"{br} Trade {n:Totoroon} a {i:Date|Date|5566}, {i:Pamamas|Pamamas|4468}, or {i:Kazham Pineapple|Kazham Pineapple|4432}. {i:Wild Pamamas|Wild Pamamas|4596} do not work.{br} The sweets you trade to {n:Totoroon} will influence which zone has the treasure. __(verification needed)__
* Trading **{i:Date|Date|5566}** will make the treasure zone **{z:Bhaflau Thickets}** or **{z:Wajaom Woodlands}**.
* Trading **{i:Pamamas|Pamamas|4468}** will make the treasure zone **{z:Bhaflau Thickets}** or **{z:Wajaom Woodlands}**.
* Trading **{i:Kazham Pineapple|Kazham Pineapple|4432}** will make the treasure zone **{z:Caedarva Mire}** or **{z:Mount Zhayolm}**.

Acquire appropriate gathering tools and travel to the indicated treasure zone. {br} See zone sections below for more information about the __gathering tool__, __gathering points map__ and __NM__. {br} Find the {i:??? Box|??? Box|2286} by {p:Harvesting}, {p:Logging}, or {p:Mining} within the treasure zone.
* First time completion of this quest may not yield the {i:??? Box|??? Box|2286}, instead a message "You have a feeling might find something here!", if this occurs just simply return to {n:Totoroon} to complete this quest.
* A NM has a chance of spawning while {p:Harvesting}, {p:Logging}, or {p:Mining} when this quest is active.
* Killing the NM is not required, but if killed, the {i:??? Box|??? Box|2286} will no longer be available from subsequent gathering attempts.
* Only one {i:??? Box|??? Box|2286} can be harvested. The NM will not spawn on further {p:Harvesting}, {p:Logging}, or {p:Mining} attempts after you find the {i:??? Box|??? Box|2286}.

Once you have the {i:??? Box|??? Box|2286}, speak with {n:Totoroon} to complete the quest. If a NM spawned upon a gathering, this validates the quest.
* If you have previously completed the quest there will be no cutscene ending the quest. There is no point in returning to {n:Totoroon}.

Identify the {i:??? Box|??? Box|2286} by trading it to {n:Memeroon} at (G-8) behind the {p:Survival Guide}.
=4 {z:Bhaflau Thickets}
Bring multiple {i:Sickles|Sickle|1020} for {p:Harvesting} in this zone, {i:Sickles|Sickle|1020} will break occasionally. {br} Refer to the {p:Bhaflau Thickets Harvesting points map|Harvesting}. {br} {p:Harvesting} with a {i:Sickle|Sickle|1020} has a chance of producing a {i:??? Box|??? Box|2286}. {br} The NM {m:Berried Chigoe} and five {m:Chigoe's Nit} may spawn while {p:Harvesting} when this quest is active.
=4 {z:Caedarva Mire}
Bring multiple {i:Hatchets|Hatchet|1021} for {p:Logging} in this zone, {i:Hatchets|Hatchet|1021} will break occasionally. {br} Refer to the {p:Caedarva Mire Logging points map|Logging}. {br} {p:Logging} with a {i:Hatchet|Hatchet|1021} has a chance of producing a {i:??? Box|??? Box|2286}. {br} The NM {m:Ravin Raven} may spawn while {p:Logging} when this quest is active.
=4 {z:Mount Zhayolm}
Bring multiple {i:Pickaxes|Pickaxe|605} for {p:Mining} in this zone, {i:Pickaxes|Pickaxe|605} will break occasionally. {br} Refer to the {p:Mount Zhayolm Mining points map|Mining}. {br} {p:Mining} with a {i:Pickaxe|Pickaxe|605} has a chance of producing a {i:??? Box|??? Box|2286}. {br} The NM {m:Ancient Bombs} may spawn while {p:Mining} when this quest is active.
=4 {z:Wajaom Woodlands}
Bring multiple {i:Sickles|Sickle|1020} for {p:Harvesting} in this zone, {i:Sickles|Sickle|1020} will break occasionally. {br} Refer to the {p:Wajaom Woodlands Harvesting points map|Harvesting}. {br} {p:Harvesting} with a {i:Sickle|Sickle|1020} has a chance of producing a {i:??? Box|??? Box|2286}. {br} The NM {m:Berried Chigoe} and five {m:Chigoe's Nit} may spawn while {p:Harvesting} when this quest is active.
=2 Rewards
Boxes from {z:Wajaom Woodlands} and {z:Bhaflau Thickets} typically contain Clothcrafting materials. {br} Boxes from {z:Caedarva Mire} and {z:Mount Zhayolm} typically contain Goldsmithing materials. {br} {i:??? Box|??? Box|2286} has contained:
* {i:Rainbow Thread|Rainbow Thread|821}; {i:Gold Thread|Gold Thread|823}; {i:Silver Thread|Silver Thread|822}; {i:Wool Thread|Wool Thread|820}; {i:Light Opal|Light Opal|796}; {i:Sunstone|Sunstone|803}; {i:Jadeite|Jadeite|784}; {i:Aquamarine|Aquamarine|791}; {i:Turquoise|Turquoise|798}; {i:Sphene|Sphene|815}; {i:Sardonyx|Sardonyx|807}; {i:Pearl|Pearl|792}; {p:Black Pearl}; {i:Luminium Ore|Luminium Ore|2228}; {i:Peridot|Peridot|788}; {i:Fluorite|Fluorite|810}; {i:Garnet|Garnet|790}; {i:Moonstone|Moonstone|802}; {i:Diamond|Diamond|787}; {i:Philosopher's Stone|Philosopher's Stone|942}; {i:Beast Blood|Beast Blood|2015}; {i:Linen Cloth|Linen Cloth|826}; {i:Iron Chain|Iron Chain|680}; {i:H. Q. Crab Shell}; {i:Light Anima|Light Anima|1647}; {i:Parchment|Parchment|917}; {i:Silver Thread|Silver Thread|822}; {i:Wool Thread|Wool Thread|820}

